This package is using .First.lib to load its compiled code, and that
workaround will be removed shortly (it was only ever intended to help
transitioning for 2.14.0 a year ago).

This should be replaced by .onLoad now all packages have namespaces,
or preferably by a useDynLib declaration in the NAMESPACE file.

So we need an update to the package which does not use .First.lib.

